   "questionHtml": "תהי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> קבוצה לא ריקה. הוכיחו או הפריכו: אם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⊆</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_2,R_1\\subseteq A\\times A</annotation></semantics></math></span> יחסים אנטי-סימטריים, אז גם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_2\\cup R_1</annotation></semantics></math></span> אנטי-סימטרי.",
   "solutionHtml": "הטענה אינה נכונה. דוגמה נגדית:<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=\\{1,2\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>. היחסים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_1=\\{(1,2)\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_2=\\{(2,1)\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> אנטי-סימטריים.<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_1\\cup R_2=\\{(1,2),(2,1)\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> אינו אנטי-סימטרי, כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\ne2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
