   "year": 2018,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "קומבינטוריקה",
   "questionHtml": "חשבו את <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)=\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\left(\\binom{n}{k}\\cdot\\left(3^k+4^k\\right)\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span> ובדקו האם: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)=O(7^n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><msup><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><msup><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)=\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk3^k+\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk4^k=\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk3^k1^{n-k}+\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk4^k1^{n-k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=(3+1)^n+(4+1)^n=4^n+5^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)=4^n+5^n</annotation></semantics></math></span>, לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\in\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>מכיוון ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>≤</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4^n\\le7^n</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>≤</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5^n\\le7^n</annotation></semantics></math></span> לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\in\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, נקבל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)=4^n+5^n\\le2\\cdot7^n</annotation></semantics></math></span> לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\in\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>מסקנה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)=O(7^n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
