   "questionHtml": "הוכיחו או הפריכו:<br><strong>(1)</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi><mo>∩</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\mathbb{Q}\\cap(0,1)|=|\\mathbb{Z}|</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><strong>(2)</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(A\\times B)=P(A)\\times P(B)</annotation></semantics></math></span> לכל 2 קבוצות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A,B</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<strong>(1)</strong> הטענה נכונה, כי:<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo fence=\"true\">}</mo></mrow><mo>⊆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi><mo>∩</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⊆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\left\\{\\frac12,\\frac1{2^2},\\frac1{2^3},\\ldots\\right\\}\\subseteq\\mathbb{Q}\\cap(0,1)\\subseteq\\mathbb{Q}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo fence=\"true\">}</mo></mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi><mo>∩</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\mathbb{Z}|=|\\mathbb{N}|=\\left|\\left\\{\\frac12,\\frac1{2^2},\\ldots\\right\\}\\right|\\le|\\mathbb{Q}\\cap(0,1)|\\le|\\mathbb{Q}|=|\\mathbb{Z}|</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℵ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi><mo>∩</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\aleph_0=|\\mathbb{Q}\\cap(0,1)|=|\\mathbb{Z}|</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><strong>(2)</strong> הטענה אינה נכונה. דוגמה נגדית: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=\\{1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B=\\{2\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\{1\\},\\{2\\})\\in P(A)\\times P(B)</annotation></semantics></math></span>, אך <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\{1\\},\\{2\\})\\notin P(A\\times B)</annotation></semantics></math></span>,<br>כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(A\\times B)=P(\\{(1,2)\\})=\\{\\varnothing,\\{(1,2)\\}\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "pointsTotal": 9
