   "year": 2018,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "קומבינטוריקה",
   "questionHtml": "חשבו את <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)=\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\left(\\binom{n}{k}\\cdot\\left(3^{2k}+2^{2k}\\right)\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span> והראו ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)=O(10^n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mn>9</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mn>9</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><msup><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><msup><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)=\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk9^k+\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk4^k=\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk9^k1^{n-k}+\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk4^k1^{n-k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=(9+1)^n+(4+1)^n=10^n+5^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>≤</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)=10^n+5^n\\le10^n+10^n=2\\cdot10^n</annotation></semantics></math></span> לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\in\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>לכן, עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_0=0\\in\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_0=2&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span> מתקיים: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)\\le c_0\\cdot10^n</annotation></semantics></math></span> לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\in\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>מסקנה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)=O(10^n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
