   "question": "הגדירו את המושג של **מכפלה קרטזית** של 2 קבוצות.\nתנו דוגמאות של קבוצות שונות וסופיות $A_1,B_1,A_2,B_2$ כך ש: $A_1\\times B_1\\ne B_1\\times A_1$ ו: $A_2\\times B_2=B_2\\times A_2$.",
   "solution": "**הגדרה:** תהיינה $A,B$ קבוצות. המכפלה הקרטזית של $A$ ו-$B$ היא $A\\times B=\\{(a,b):\\ a\\in A\\wedge b\\in B\\}$.\n**דוגמאות:**\n$B_1=\\{2\\}$, $A_1=\\{1\\}$: $A_1\\times B_1=\\{(1,2)\\}\\ne\\{(2,1)\\}=B_1\\times A_1$.\n$B_2=\\varnothing$, $A_2=\\{1\\}$: $A_2\\times B_2=\\varnothing=B_2\\times A_2$.",
   "solutionSource": "student-solution",
   "official": false,
   "confidence": "med",
   "id": "18B-A-Q1a",
   "partKey": "a",
   "examCode": "18B-A",
   "examLabel": "בדידה 1, סמסטר ב' תשע\"ח, מועד א (08.07.2018)",
   "year": 2018,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "קבוצות וקבוצת חזקה",
   "questionHtml": "הגדירו את המושג של <strong>מכפלה קרטזית</strong> של 2 קבוצות.<br>תנו דוגמאות של קבוצות שונות וסופיות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_1,B_1,A_2,B_2</annotation></semantics></math></span> כך ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_1\\times B_1\\ne B_1\\times A_1</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_2\\times B_2=B_2\\times A_2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<strong>הגדרה:</strong> תהיינה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A,B</annotation></semantics></math></span> קבוצות. המכפלה הקרטזית של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> היא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>a</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A\\times B=\\{(a,b):\\ a\\in A\\wedge b\\in B\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><strong>דוגמאות:</strong><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_1=\\{2\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_1=\\{1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_1\\times B_1=\\{(1,2)\\}\\ne\\{(2,1)\\}=B_1\\times A_1</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_2=\\varnothing</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_2=\\{1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_2\\times B_2=\\varnothing=B_2\\times A_2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
