   "question": "חשבו את $f(n)=\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\left(\\binom{n}{k}\\cdot\\left(2^k\\cdot3^k+5^n\\right)\\right)$ והראו ש: $f(n)=O(11^n)$.",
   "solution": "$f(n)=\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk(2\\cdot3)^k+5^n\\cdot\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk=S_1+S_2$.\n$(x+1)^n=\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nkx^k$. עבור $x=6$: $S_1=\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk6^k=7^n$. עבור $x=1$: $S_2=\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk=2^n$.\n$$f(n)=7^n+5^n\\cdot2^n=7^n+10^n\\le2\\cdot10^n\\le2\\cdot11^n=c_0\\cdot11^n$$\nעבור $c_0=2$ ו-$n_0=1\\le n\\in\\mathbb{N}$. מסקנה: $f(n)=O(11^n)$.",
   "solutionSource": "student-solution",
   "official": false,
   "confidence": "med",
   "id": "18B-A-Q2c",
   "partKey": "c",
   "examCode": "18B-A",
   "examLabel": "בדידה 1, סמסטר ב' תשע\"ח, מועד א (08.07.2018)",
   "year": 2018,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "קומבינטוריקה",
   "questionHtml": "חשבו את <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)=\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\left(\\binom{n}{k}\\cdot\\left(2^k\\cdot3^k+5^n\\right)\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span> והראו ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>11</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)=O(11^n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)=\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk(2\\cdot3)^k+5^n\\cdot\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk=S_1+S_2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x+1)^n=\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nkx^k</annotation></semantics></math></span>. עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=6</annotation></semantics></math></span>: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mn>6</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_1=\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk6^k=7^n</annotation></semantics></math></span>. עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=1</annotation></semantics></math></span>: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_2=\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk=2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>11</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>11</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)=7^n+5^n\\cdot2^n=7^n+10^n\\le2\\cdot10^n\\le2\\cdot11^n=c_0\\cdot11^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_0=2</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_0=1\\le n\\in\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span>. מסקנה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>11</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)=O(11^n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "pointsTotal": 5
