   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> הפיכה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iff f</annotation></semantics></math></span> חד-חד-ערכית ועל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iff f</annotation></semantics></math></span> תמורה של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{1,2,\\ldots,7\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>בנוסף: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(\\{1,2,3\\})=\\{1,2,3\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span> <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3!</annotation></semantics></math></span> אפשרויות; ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(\\{4,5,6,7\\})=\\{4,5,6,7\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span> <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4!</annotation></semantics></math></span> אפשרויות.<br>מסקנה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>144</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3!\\cdot4!=144</annotation></semantics></math></span> פונקציות מתאימות.",
