   "topicLabel": "חשבון מודולרי, פרמה, וילסון",
   "questionHtml": "בדקו האם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo>∘</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8\\mid(\\varnothing\\circ\\varnothing)(n+n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>11</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msup><mn>70</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=\\gcd(11,\\,70^{10}-1)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">11</annotation></semantics></math></span> ראשוני ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>∤</mo><mn>70</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">11\\nmid70</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן לפי משפט FERMAT: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>∣</mo><msup><mn>70</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">11\\mid70^{10}-1</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>11</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mn>70</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gcd(11,70^{10}-1)=11</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=11</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>121</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>132</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>33</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^2+n=121+11=132=4\\cdot33=2^2\\cdot3\\cdot11</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>132</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>132</mn><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>11</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>11</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varnothing(132)=132\\left(1-\\frac12\\right)\\left(1-\\frac13\\right)\\left(1-\\frac1{11}\\right)=2^2\\cdot3\\cdot11\\cdot\\frac12\\cdot\\frac23\\cdot\\frac{10}{11}=40</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo>∘</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>132</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>132</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>40</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn>5</mn><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\varnothing\\circ\\varnothing)(132)=\\varnothing(\\varnothing(132))=\\varnothing(40)=\\varnothing(2^3\\cdot5)=2^3\\cdot5\\left(1-\\frac12\\right)\\left(1-\\frac15\\right)=8\\cdot5\\cdot\\frac12\\cdot\\frac45=16</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>מסקנה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>∣</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8\\mid16</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo>∘</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8\\mid(\\varnothing\\circ\\varnothing)(n^2+n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>. התשובה: כן.",
