   "questionHtml": "שלולו את הטענה:<br>\"לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\in A</annotation></semantics></math></span>, קיימים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y\\in B</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\in C</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כך ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=y+z</annotation></semantics></math></span>\" כך שבתשובתכם לא יופיע קשר השלילה.",
   "solutionHtml": "השלילה: \"קיים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\in A</annotation></semantics></math></span> כך שלכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y\\in B</annotation></semantics></math></span> ולכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z\\in C</annotation></semantics></math></span> מתקיים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\ne y+z</annotation></semantics></math></span>\"."
