   "topicLabel": "יחסי שקילות",
   "questionHtml": "<strong>(ב1)</strong> תהי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=\\{1,2,3,\\ldots,n\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7&lt;n\\in\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span>. יהי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R\\subseteq A\\times A</annotation></semantics></math></span> יחס שקילות שמקיים את התנאים הבאים: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A/R=\\{B,C,D\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|B|=2</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|C|=3</annotation></semantics></math></span>. חשבו את <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|R|</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "נסמן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D=A-(B\\cup C)</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|D|=n-5</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B\\times B\\subseteq R</annotation></semantics></math></span> כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[b_1]=[b_2]=B</annotation></semantics></math></span> כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B=\\{b_1,b_2\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>; <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C\\times C\\subseteq R</annotation></semantics></math></span> כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[c_1]=[c_2]=[c_3]=C</annotation></semantics></math></span> כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C=\\{c_1,c_2,c_3\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>; <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D\\times D\\subseteq R</annotation></semantics></math></span> כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[d_i]=D</annotation></semantics></math></span> כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D=\\{d_1,\\ldots\\}=A-(B\\cup C)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>מסקנה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∪</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∪</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R=(B\\times B)\\cup(C\\times C)\\cup(D\\times D)</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>C</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>D</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|R|=|B|^2+|C|^2+|D|^2=4+9+(n-5)^2</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
