   "questionHtml": "<strong>(א2)</strong> תהי הקבוצה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>20</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=\\{1,2,3,\\ldots,20\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>. מהו מספר היחסים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R\\subseteq A\\times A</annotation></semantics></math></span> שמקיימים התנאי: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\le|R|\\le5</annotation></semantics></math></span> ?",
   "solutionHtml": "בהינתן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>20</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>400</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|A\\times A|=|A|\\cdot|A|=20^2=400</annotation></semantics></math></span>, נקבל:<br>מספר היחסים בגודל 3 הוא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mn>400</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\binom{400}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, בגודל 4 הוא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mn>400</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\binom{400}{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ובגודל 5 הוא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mn>400</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\binom{400}{5}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>מסקנה: מספר היחסים הוא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mn>400</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mn>400</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mn>400</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\binom{400}{3}+\\binom{400}{4}+\\binom{400}{5}</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
