   "topicLabel": "קבוצות וקבוצת חזקה",
   "questionHtml": "<strong>(ב2)</strong> כמה תתי-קבוצות של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots,9\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> מכילות את כל המספרים הזוגיים של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> ?",
   "solutionHtml": "נבחר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>∪</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C=\\{0,2,4,6,8\\}\\cup D</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D\\subseteq\\{1,3,5,7,9\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> תת-קבוצה כלשהי.<br>מספר תתי-הקבוצות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span> שווה למספר תתי-הקבוצות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span> של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{1,3,5,7,9\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|P(\\{1,3,5,7,9\\})|=2^5</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>מסקנה: מספר תתי-הקבוצות של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> שמכילות את כל המספרים הזוגיים הוא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^5=32</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
