   "question": "יהי $1<n\\in\\mathbb{N}$. חשבו את הסכום: $f(n)=\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\left(\\binom nk\\cdot\\left(3^{2k}+2^{2k}\\right)\\right)$.",
   "solution": "$f(n)=S_1+S_2$, כאשר $S_1=\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk3^{2k}$ ו-$S_2=\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk2^{2k}$.\n$S_1=\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk9^k=\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk9^k1^{n-k}=(9+1)^n=10^n$\n$S_2=\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk4^k=\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk4^k1^{n-k}=(4+1)^n=5^n$\nמסקנה: $f(n)=10^n+5^n$.",
