   "year": 2019,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "פונקציות",
   "questionHtml": "<strong>(א1)</strong> תהיינה הקבוצות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=\\{1,2,3,\\ldots,10\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>20</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B=\\{1,2,\\ldots,20\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>. מהו מספר היחסים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R\\subseteq A\\times A</annotation></semantics></math></span> שהם פונקציות, אך לא חד-חד-ערכיות ?",
   "solutionHtml": "מספר הפונקציות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f:A\\to A</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{10}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כי לכל אחד מ-10 האיברים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(1),\\ldots,f(10)\\in A</annotation></semantics></math></span> יש 10 אפשרויות, וכל אחת מהפונקציות מגדירה יחס.<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f:A\\to A</annotation></semantics></math></span> היא חד-חד-ערכית <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iff f</annotation></semantics></math></span> הפיכה, כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> סופית, ומספר הפונקציות הללו הוא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>⋯</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\cdot9\\cdot8\\cdots1=10!</annotation></semantics></math></span> (<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(1)\\in A</annotation></semantics></math></span>: 10 אפשרויות, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(2)\\in A-\\{f(1)\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>: 9 אפשרויות, ... , <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>9</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(10)\\in A-\\{f(1),\\ldots,f(9)\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>: אפשרות אחת).<br>מסקנה: מספר היחסים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R\\subseteq A\\times A</annotation></semantics></math></span> שהם פונקציות אך לא חד-חד-ערכיות הוא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{10}-10!</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
