   "question": "**(ב1)** נתון $C=\\{1,2,3,4,5\\}$ ו-$\\Omega=\\{\\{1,2\\},\\{3\\},\\{4,5\\}\\}$. הראו כי קיים יחס שקילות $R\\subseteq C\\times C$ כך ש: $\\Omega=C/R$.",
   "solution": "נסמן $\\Omega=\\{A_1,A_2,A_3\\}$, כאשר $A_1=\\{1,2\\}$, $A_2=\\{3\\}$, $A_3=\\{4,5\\}$. $\\Omega$ היא חלוקה של $C$, כי:\n(1) $A_i\\ne\\varnothing$ לכל $i$; (2) $A_i\\cap A_j=\\varnothing$ לכל $i\\ne j$; (3) $A_1\\cup A_2\\cup A_3=C$.\nלכן קיים יחס שקילות $R\\subseteq C\\times C$ כך ש-$C/R=\\Omega$.",
   "solutionSource": "student-solution",
   "official": false,
   "confidence": "med",
   "id": "19A-B-Q4c",
   "partKey": "c",
   "examCode": "19A-B",
   "examLabel": "בדידה 1, תשע\"ט, מועד ב (2019)",
   "year": 2019,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "יחסי שקילות",
   "questionHtml": "<strong>(ב1)</strong> נתון <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C=\\{1,2,3,4,5\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega=\\{\\{1,2\\},\\{3\\},\\{4,5\\}\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>. הראו כי קיים יחס שקילות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R\\subseteq C\\times C</annotation></semantics></math></span> כך ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega=C/R</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "נסמן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega=\\{A_1,A_2,A_3\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_1=\\{1,2\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_2=\\{3\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_3=\\{4,5\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>. <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span> היא חלוקה של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כי:<br>(1) <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_i\\ne\\varnothing</annotation></semantics></math></span> לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span>; (2) <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∩</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_i\\cap A_j=\\varnothing</annotation></semantics></math></span> לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i\\ne j</annotation></semantics></math></span>; (3) <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_1\\cup A_2\\cup A_3=C</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>לכן קיים יחס שקילות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R\\subseteq C\\times C</annotation></semantics></math></span> כך ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C/R=\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "pointsTotal": 5
