   "questionHtml": "הוכיחו ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi><mo>∩</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\mathbb{Q}\\cap(1,5]|=|\\mathbb{N}\\times\\mathbb{N}|</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<strong>טענה 1:</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\mathbb{Q}|=|\\mathbb{N}\\times\\mathbb{N}|=|\\mathbb{N}|</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><strong>טענה 2:</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi><mo>∩</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\mathbb{Q}\\cap(1,5]|\\le|\\mathbb{Q}|</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi><mo>∩</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>⊆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{Q}\\cap(1,5]\\subseteq\\mathbb{Q}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><strong>טענה 3:</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi><mo>∩</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{Q}\\cap(1,5]</annotation></semantics></math></span> היא קבוצה אינסופית: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>…</mo><mo fence=\"true\">}</mo></mrow><mo>⊆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi><mo>∩</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B=\\left\\{1+\\frac12,\\ 1+\\frac13,\\ 1+\\frac14,\\ \\ldots,\\ 1+\\frac1n,\\ \\ldots\\right\\}\\subseteq\\mathbb{Q}\\cap(1,5]</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi><mo>∩</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\mathbb{N}|=|B|\\le|\\mathbb{Q}\\cap(1,5]|</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><strong>מסקנה:</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi><mo>∩</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\mathbb{N}|=|B|\\le|\\mathbb{Q}\\cap(1,5]|\\le|\\mathbb{Q}|=|\\mathbb{N}|</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi><mo>∩</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\mathbb{Q}\\cap(1,5]|=|\\mathbb{N}|=|\\mathbb{N}\\times\\mathbb{N}|</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
