   "points": 8,
   "question": "מצאו את הצורה המפורשת של $(a_n)$, כאשר: $a_n=6a_{n-1}-9a_{n-2}$ לכל $2\\le n\\in\\mathbb{N}$, $a_0=5$, $a_1=21$.",
   "solution": "המשוואה האופיינית: $r^2-6r+9=0$, ולכן $r_1=r_2=3$. לכן $a_n=C_1\\cdot3^n+C_2\\cdot n\\cdot3^n$.\n$a_0=C_1=5$\n$a_1=3C_1+3C_2=21\\ \\Rightarrow\\ C_1+C_2=7$\nנקבל $C_1=5$, $C_2=2$.\nמסקנה: $a_n=5\\cdot3^n+2\\cdot n\\cdot3^n$, לכל $n\\in\\mathbb{N}$.",
   "solutionSource": "student-solution",
   "official": false,
   "confidence": "med",
   "id": "19A-B-Q5d",
   "partKey": "d",
   "examCode": "19A-B",
   "examLabel": "בדידה 1, תשע\"ט, מועד ב (2019)",
   "year": 2019,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "סכומים ונוסחאות נסיגה",
   "questionHtml": "מצאו את הצורה המפורשת של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(a_n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כאשר: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n=6a_{n-1}-9a_{n-2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\le n\\in\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_0=5</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>21</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_1=21</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "המשוואה האופיינית: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^2-6r+9=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_1=r_2=3</annotation></semantics></math></span>. לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n=C_1\\cdot3^n+C_2\\cdot n\\cdot3^n</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_0=C_1=5</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>21</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_1=3C_1+3C_2=21\\ \\Rightarrow\\ C_1+C_2=7</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>נקבל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_1=5</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_2=2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>מסקנה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n=5\\cdot3^n+2\\cdot n\\cdot3^n</annotation></semantics></math></span>, לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\in\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "pointsTotal": 8
