   "questionHtml": "חשבו את הסכום <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)=\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk4^k</annotation></semantics></math></span>. האם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)=O(4^n)</annotation></semantics></math></span> ?",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><msup><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)=\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk4^k=\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk4^k1^{n-k}=(4+1)^n=5^n</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>האם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)=5^n=O(4^n)</annotation></semantics></math></span> ? נניח בשלילה ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5^n=O(4^n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>: אז קיימים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_0&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_0\\in\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span> כך ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5^n\\le c_0\\cdot4^n</annotation></semantics></math></span> לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_0\\le n\\in\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dfrac{5^n}{4^n}\\le c_0</annotation></semantics></math></span> לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_0\\le n\\in\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>אך <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\left(\\dfrac54\\right)^n=\\infty\\le c_0</annotation></semantics></math></span>, סתירה.<br>מסקנה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)\\ne O(4^n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
