   "topicLabel": "קומבינטוריקה",
   "questionHtml": "<strong>(ג1)</strong> נתונים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\ge10</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=\\{1,2,3,\\ldots,n\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>. חשבו את <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>B</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∧</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo>∧</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>∈</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\left|\\{B:\\ B\\in P(A)\\wedge\\{1,2,3,4\\}\\cap B=\\varnothing\\wedge7\\in B\\}\\right|</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "לפי ההגדרה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>∪</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B=\\{7\\}\\cup C</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C\\subseteq\\{5,6,8,\\ldots,n\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C\\in P(\\{5,6,8,\\ldots,n\\})</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>מספר ה-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span>-ים שווה למספר ה-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span>-ים: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|P(\\{5,6,8,\\ldots,n\\})|=2^{|\\{5,6,8,\\ldots,n\\}|}=2^{n-5}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\{5,6,8,\\ldots,n\\}|=|\\{1,2,\\ldots,n\\}-\\{1,2,3,4,7\\}|=n-5</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
