   "questionHtml": "<strong>(ג2)</strong> תהי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span> קבוצה בת 8 איברים. חשבו את <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varnothing(m^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varnothing</annotation></semantics></math></span> היא פונקציית Euler ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא מספר תתי-הקבוצות בגודל 4 של הקבוצה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "נתון: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span> היא קבוצה בת 8 איברים, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mn>8</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m=\\binom84</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא מספר תתי-הקבוצות בגודל 4.<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mn>70</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m=\\dfrac{8!}{4!\\,4!}=\\dfrac{5\\cdot6\\cdot7\\cdot8}{2\\cdot3\\cdot4}=70=2\\cdot5\\cdot7</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>70</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>70</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>70</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>70</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>70</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1680</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varnothing(m^2)=\\varnothing(70^2)=\\varnothing(2^2\\cdot5^2\\cdot7^2)=70^2\\left(1-\\frac12\\right)\\left(1-\\frac15\\right)\\left(1-\\frac17\\right)=70\\cdot70\\cdot\\frac12\\cdot\\frac45\\cdot\\frac67=70\\cdot24=1680</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
