   "questionHtml": "<strong>(א2)</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span> היא קבוצת כל הפונקציות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>→</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f:\\{1,2,3,4\\}\\to\\{1,2,3,4,5,6\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>. כמה פונקציות מ-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span> הן יורדות ממש?",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f\\in F</annotation></semantics></math></span> יורדת ממש <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iff f(1)&gt;f(2)&gt;f(3)&gt;f(4)</annotation></semantics></math></span>. כל תת-קבוצה של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{1,2,\\ldots,6\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> בגודל 4 מגדירה פונקציה אחת בלבד שיורדת ממש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{f(1),f(2),f(3),f(4)\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>לכן מספר הפונקציות היורדות ממש הוא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mn>6</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\binom64=\\binom62=\\dfrac{6\\cdot5}{1\\cdot2}=15</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
