   "questionHtml": "<strong>(ג2)</strong> תהי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=\\{1,2,3,4,5,6\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>. מהו מספר התמורות של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> שבהן המספרים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1,2,3</annotation></semantics></math></span> נמצאים בסמיכות?",
   "solutionHtml": "נתייחס לבלוק <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1,2,3</annotation></semantics></math></span> כאל יחידה אחת: יש <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4!</annotation></semantics></math></span> סידורים של 4 היחידות (<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1,2,3</annotation></semantics></math></span> כבלוק, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4,5,6</annotation></semantics></math></span>), ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3!</annotation></semantics></math></span> סידורים פנימיים של הבלוק.<br>לכן מספר התמורות הוא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>144</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">144=24\\cdot6=4!\\cdot3!</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
