   "points": 10,
   "question": "אם $3<n\\in\\mathbb{N}$ הוא מספר שמקיים $3\\mid n$, הראו ש: $3\\cdot\\varnothing(n)=\\varnothing(3n)$, כאשר $\\varnothing$ היא פונקציית Euler. רמז: היעזרו בנוסחת אוילר ל-$n$ כללי.",
   "solution": "$3\\mid n\\iff n=3^\\alpha\\cdot m$ עבור $1\\le\\alpha$ ו-$\\gcd(3,m)=1$.\n$\\varnothing(n)=\\varnothing(3^\\alpha)\\cdot\\varnothing(m)=3^\\alpha\\left(1-\\frac13\\right)\\varnothing(m)=3^{\\alpha-1}\\cdot2\\cdot\\varnothing(m)$.\n$\\varnothing(3n)=\\varnothing(3^{\\alpha+1}\\cdot m)=\\varnothing(3^{\\alpha+1})\\varnothing(m)=3^{\\alpha+1}\\left(1-\\frac13\\right)\\varnothing(m)=3\\cdot3^{\\alpha-1}\\cdot2\\cdot\\varnothing(m)=3\\varnothing(n)$.\nמסקנה: $\\varnothing(3n)=3\\varnothing(n)$.",
   "solutionSource": "student-solution",
   "official": false,
   "confidence": "med",
   "id": "19S-A-Q5a",
   "partKey": "a",
   "examCode": "19S-A",
   "examLabel": "בדידה 1, סמסטר ב' תשע\"ט, מועד א (01.07.2019)",
   "year": 2019,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "חשבון מודולרי, פרמה, וילסון",
   "questionHtml": "אם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3&lt;n\\in\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא מספר שמקיים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\mid n</annotation></semantics></math></span>, הראו ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\cdot\\varnothing(n)=\\varnothing(3n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varnothing</annotation></semantics></math></span> היא פונקציית Euler. רמז: היעזרו בנוסחת אוילר ל-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span> כללי.",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>n</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>α</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\mid n\\iff n=3^\\alpha\\cdot m</annotation></semantics></math></span> עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\le\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gcd(3,m)=1</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>α</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>α</mi></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varnothing(n)=\\varnothing(3^\\alpha)\\cdot\\varnothing(m)=3^\\alpha\\left(1-\\frac13\\right)\\varnothing(m)=3^{\\alpha-1}\\cdot2\\cdot\\varnothing(m)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varnothing(3n)=\\varnothing(3^{\\alpha+1}\\cdot m)=\\varnothing(3^{\\alpha+1})\\varnothing(m)=3^{\\alpha+1}\\left(1-\\frac13\\right)\\varnothing(m)=3\\cdot3^{\\alpha-1}\\cdot2\\cdot\\varnothing(m)=3\\varnothing(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>מסקנה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varnothing(3n)=3\\varnothing(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
