   "questionHtml": "הוכיחו ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi><mo>∩</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∪</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi><mo>∩</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>20.5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>100.5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\left|(\\mathbb{Q}\\cap[1,5])\\cup(\\mathbb{Z}\\cap[20.5,100.5])\\right|=|\\mathbb{Z}|</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "נסמן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi><mo>∩</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∪</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi><mo>∩</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>20.5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>100.5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=(\\mathbb{Q}\\cap[1,5])\\cup(\\mathbb{Z}\\cap[20.5,100.5])</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>מכיוון ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A\\subseteq\\mathbb{Q}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|A|\\le|\\mathbb{Q}|</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> יש תת-קבוצה אינסופית שניתנת לסידור בסדרה של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span>: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>…</mo><mo fence=\"true\">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B=\\left\\{1+\\frac12,\\ 1+\\frac13,\\ 1+\\frac14,\\ \\ldots,\\ 1+\\frac1n,\\ \\ldots\\right\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\mathbb{Z}|=|\\mathbb{N}|=|B|\\le|A|\\le|\\mathbb{Q}|=|\\mathbb{N}|=|\\mathbb{Z}|</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>מסקנה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|A|=|\\mathbb{Z}|</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
