   "questionHtml": "מצאו את הקוטר של הגרף שבציור הבא:",
   "solutionHtml": "מספיק לחשב את המרחק מ-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span> ומ-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> לכל שאר הצמתים ולהסתכל על הגדול ביותר.<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">dist</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">dist</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">dist</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{dist}(a,b)=\\operatorname{dist}(a,f)=\\operatorname{dist}(a,e)=1</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">dist</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{dist}(a,v)=2</annotation></semantics></math></span> לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>j</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>g</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v\\in\\{j,g,i,h,c,d\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">dist</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">dist</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">dist</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{dist}(f,a)=\\operatorname{dist}(f,i)=\\operatorname{dist}(f,h)=1</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">dist</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{dist}(f,v)=2</annotation></semantics></math></span> לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>j</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v\\in\\{j,b,c,d,e,g\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>מסקנה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">diam</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{diam}(G)=2</annotation></semantics></math></span> (<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">dist</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\max\\{\\operatorname{dist}(x,y):\\ x,y\\in V\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>)."
