   "question": "חשבו את $\\left(16^{15}+7^{60}+37\\right)\\pmod{31}$.",
   "solution": "$16^{15}+7^{60}+37=4^{2\\cdot15}+(7^2)^{30}+31+6=(4^{31-1}-1)+(49^{31-1}-1)+31+8$.\nמכיוון ש-31 ראשוני, $31\\nmid4$ ו-$31\\nmid49$, לפי פרמה: $4^{31-1}-1=31k$ ו-$49^{31-1}-1=31m$ עבור $k,m\\in\\mathbb{Z}$.\nלכן $\\left(16^{15}+7^{60}+37\\right)\\pmod{31}=(31k+31m+31+8)\\pmod{31}=(31(k+m+1)+8)\\pmod{31}=8$.",
   "solutionSource": "student-solution",
   "official": false,
   "confidence": "med",
   "id": "22A-A-Q1c",
   "partKey": "c",
   "examCode": "22A-A",
   "examLabel": "בדידה 1, סמסטר א' תשפ\"ב, מועד א (25.01.2022), שתי גרסאות",
   "year": 2022,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "חשבון מודולרי, פרמה, וילסון",
   "questionHtml": "חשבו את <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mn>16</mn><mn>15</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>60</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>37</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mspace></mspace><mspace width=\"0.4444em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mspace width=\"0.3333em\"/><mn>31</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\left(16^{15}+7^{60}+37\\right)\\pmod{31}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>16</mn><mn>15</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>60</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>37</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>30</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>31</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>31</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>49</mn><mrow><mn>31</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>31</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16^{15}+7^{60}+37=4^{2\\cdot15}+(7^2)^{30}+31+6=(4^{31-1}-1)+(49^{31-1}-1)+31+8</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>מכיוון ש-31 ראשוני, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>31</mn><mo>∤</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">31\\nmid4</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>31</mn><mo>∤</mo><mn>49</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">31\\nmid49</annotation></semantics></math></span>, לפי פרמה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>31</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>31</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4^{31-1}-1=31k</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>49</mn><mrow><mn>31</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>31</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">49^{31-1}-1=31m</annotation></semantics></math></span> עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k,m\\in\\mathbb{Z}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mn>16</mn><mn>15</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>60</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>37</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mspace></mspace><mspace width=\"0.4444em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mspace width=\"0.3333em\"/><mn>31</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>31</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>31</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>31</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace></mspace><mspace width=\"0.4444em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mspace width=\"0.3333em\"/><mn>31</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>31</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace></mspace><mspace width=\"0.4444em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mspace width=\"0.3333em\"/><mn>31</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\left(16^{15}+7^{60}+37\\right)\\pmod{31}=(31k+31m+31+8)\\pmod{31}=(31(k+m+1)+8)\\pmod{31}=8</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
