   "questionHtml": "הפונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>→</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f:\\{1,2,3,4,5,6\\}\\to A</annotation></semantics></math></span> מוגדרת לפי הכלל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mspace></mspace><mspace width=\"0.4444em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mspace width=\"0.3333em\"/><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">lcm</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(k)=k^2\\pmod6+\\operatorname{lcm}(2,\\gcd(2,k))</annotation></semantics></math></span> לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k\\in\\{1,2,3,4,5,6\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>מצאו את <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> כך ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> היא פונקציה על.",
   "solutionHtml": "חישוב הערכים:<pre class=\"code-block\" dir=\"ltr\"><code>f(1) = 1 (mod 6) + lcm(2, gcd(2,1)) = 1 + lcm(2,1) = 1 + 2 = 3\nf(2) = 4 (mod 6) + lcm(2, gcd(2,2)) = 4 + lcm(2,2) = 4 + 2 = 6\nf(3) = 9 (mod 6) + lcm(2, gcd(2,3)) = 3 + lcm(2,1) = 3 + 2 = 5\nf(4) = 16 (mod 6) + lcm(2, gcd(2,4)) = 4 + lcm(2,2) = 4 + 2 = 6\nf(5) = 25 (mod 6) + lcm(2, gcd(2,5)) = 1 + lcm(2,1) = 1 + 2 = 3\nf(6) = 36 (mod 6) + lcm(2, gcd(2,6)) = 0 + lcm(2,2) = 2</code></pre><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=f(\\{1,2,3,4,5,6\\})=\\{2,3,5,6\\}\\iff f</annotation></semantics></math></span> על, כי לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y\\in A</annotation></semantics></math></span> קיים מקור."
