   "questionHtml": "(גרסה 2)<br>חשבו את <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mn>36</mn><mn>15</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>60</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>47</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mspace></mspace><mspace width=\"0.4444em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mspace width=\"0.3333em\"/><mn>31</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\left(36^{15}+8^{60}+47\\right)\\pmod{31}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>36</mn><mn>15</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>60</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>47</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>6</mn><mn>30</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>64</mn><mn>30</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>31</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>6</mn><mrow><mn>31</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>64</mn><mrow><mn>31</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>31</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">36^{15}+8^{60}+47=6^{30}+64^{30}+31+16=(6^{31-1}-1)+(64^{31-1}-1)+31+18</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>מכיוון ש-31 ראשוני, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>31</mn><mo>∤</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">31\\nmid6</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>31</mn><mo>∤</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">31\\nmid64</annotation></semantics></math></span>, לפי פרמה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>31</mn><mo>∣</mo><msup><mn>6</mn><mrow><mn>31</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">31\\mid6^{31-1}-1</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>31</mn><mo>∣</mo><msup><mn>64</mn><mrow><mn>31</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">31\\mid64^{31-1}-1</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>מסקנה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>18</mn><mo>≡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mn>36</mn><mn>15</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>60</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>47</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mspace></mspace><mspace width=\"0.4444em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mspace width=\"0.3333em\"/><mn>31</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">18\\equiv\\left(36^{15}+8^{60}+47\\right)\\pmod{31}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר התוצאה היא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>18</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">18</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
