   "questionHtml": "(גרסה 2)<br>נסחו את ה-contrapositive של הטענה הבאה:<br>\"יהיו <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A,B,C</annotation></semantics></math></span> קבוצות לא ריקות. אם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A-B\\subseteq C</annotation></semantics></math></span>, אז <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A-C\\subseteq B</annotation></semantics></math></span>\".<br>הוכיחו את הטענה.",
   "solutionHtml": "ה-contrapositive הוא: \"אם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>⊈</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A-C\\not\\subseteq B</annotation></semantics></math></span>, אז <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>⊈</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A-B\\not\\subseteq C</annotation></semantics></math></span>\".<br><strong>הוכחת ה-contrapositive:</strong><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>⊈</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>⊈</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A-C\\not\\subseteq B\\Rightarrow\\exists x\\in A-C\\ \\wedge\\ x\\notin B\\Rightarrow x\\in A\\wedge x\\notin C\\wedge x\\notin B\\Rightarrow x\\in A-B\\wedge x\\notin C\\Rightarrow A-B\\not\\subseteq C</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><strong>בדרך השלילה:</strong> נניח בשלילה ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A-B\\subseteq C</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>⊈</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A-C\\not\\subseteq B</annotation></semantics></math></span>. אז <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>⊈</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\exists x\\in A-C\\ \\wedge\\ x\\notin B\\Rightarrow x\\in A\\wedge x\\notin C\\wedge x\\notin B\\Rightarrow x\\in A-B\\wedge x\\notin C\\Rightarrow A-B\\not\\subseteq C</annotation></semantics></math></span>, סתירה לנתון."
