   "questionHtml": "(גרסה 2)<br>תהיינה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=\\{1,2,3,4,5\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R\\subseteq A\\times A</annotation></semantics></math></span>. הוכיחו או הפריכו: אם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא יחס סדר מלא, אז <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span> אינו פונקציה.",
   "solutionHtml": "הפתרון כמו בגרסה 1.<br>נתון: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R\\subseteq\\{1,2,3,4,5\\}^2</annotation></semantics></math></span> סדר מלא.<br>מכיוון ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span> רפלקסיבי: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,1),(2,2)\\in R</annotation></semantics></math></span>. ומכיוון ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span> סדר מלא: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,2)\\in R</annotation></semantics></math></span> או <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(2,1)\\in R</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,1)\\in R</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>R</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,2)\\in R\\Rightarrow R\\ne</annotation></semantics></math></span> פונקציה.<br>או <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(2,2)\\in R</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>R</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(2,1)\\in R\\Rightarrow R\\ne</annotation></semantics></math></span> פונקציה.<br>מסקנה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span> אינו פונקציה. הטענה נכונה."
