   "topic": "induction",
   "points": 16,
   "question": "הוכיחו באינדוקציה מתמטית שלכל $n\\in\\mathbb{N},\\ 1\\le n$, מתקיים: $n^2\\le5^n$.",
   "solution": "**I. בסיס:** $P(1)$: $1^2\\le5^1\\iff1\\le5\\Rightarrow P(1)=\\text{TRUE}$.\n**II. צעד:** $P(k)=\\text{TRUE}$ עבור $1\\le k\\in\\mathbb{N}$ $\\Rightarrow$ $P(k+1)=\\text{TRUE}$.\n$P(k):\\ k^2\\le5^k$ $\\qquad$ $P(k+1):\\ (k+1)^2\\le5^{k+1}$\n$$(k+1)^2=k^2+2k+1\\le k^2+2\\cdot k^2+k^2=4k^2\\le5k^2\\le5\\cdot5^k=5^{k+1}$$\n$\\Rightarrow P(k+1)=\\text{TRUE}$.\n**III. מסקנה:** מ-I ו-II, לכל $1\\le n\\in\\mathbb{N}$ מתקיים $P(n)=\\text{TRUE}$.",
   "solutionSource": "student-solution",
   "official": false,
   "confidence": "med",
   "id": "22A-B-Q2a",
   "partKey": "a",
   "examCode": "22A-B",
   "examLabel": "בדידה 1, סמסטר א' תשפ\"ב, מועד ב (24.02.2022), שתי גרסאות",
   "year": 2022,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "אינדוקציה",
   "questionHtml": "הוכיחו באינדוקציה מתמטית שלכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\in\\mathbb{N},\\ 1\\le n</annotation></semantics></math></span>, מתקיים: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^2\\le5^n</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<strong>I. בסיס:</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span>: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>1</mn></msup><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>TRUE</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1^2\\le5^1\\iff1\\le5\\Rightarrow P(1)=\\text{TRUE}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><strong>II. צעד:</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>TRUE</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(k)=\\text{TRUE}</annotation></semantics></math></span> עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\le k\\in\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span> <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span> <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>TRUE</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(k+1)=\\text{TRUE}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(k):\\ k^2\\le5^k</annotation></semantics></math></span> <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mspace width=\"2em\"/></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\qquad</annotation></semantics></math></span> <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(k+1):\\ (k+1)^2\\le5^{k+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(k+1)^2=k^2+2k+1\\le k^2+2\\cdot k^2+k^2=4k^2\\le5k^2\\le5\\cdot5^k=5^{k+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>TRUE</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Rightarrow P(k+1)=\\text{TRUE}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><strong>III. מסקנה:</strong> מ-I ו-II, לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\le n\\in\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span> מתקיים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>TRUE</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(n)=\\text{TRUE}</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
