   "year": 2022,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "קבוצות וקבוצת חזקה",
   "questionHtml": "יהיו הקבוצות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>m</mi></msup><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=\\{3^n\\cdot5^m:\\ m,n\\in\\{0,1,2,\\ldots,10\\}\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>m</mi></msup><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>m</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B=\\{5^m:\\ m\\in\\{1,2,\\ldots,10\\}\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>חשבו את: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|A-B|+|P(A\\times B)|+|P(A\\cup B)|</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m\\in\\{1,\\ldots,10\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>m</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>m</mi></msup><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5^m=3^0\\cdot5^m\\in A</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>⊂</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B\\subset A</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>121</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>111</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|A-B|=|A|-|B|=121-10=111</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>121</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>1210</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|P(A\\times B)|=2^{|A\\times B|}=2^{|A|\\cdot|B|}=2^{121\\cdot10}=2^{1210}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>121</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|P(A\\cup B)|=|P(A)|=2^{|A|}=2^{121}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>מסקנה: <span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>121</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>1210</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>111</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{121}+2^{1210}+111</annotation></semantics></math></span>"
