   "topicLabel": "יחסים ותכונותיהם",
   "questionHtml": "תהיינה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=\\{1,2,3,4,5\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R\\subseteq A\\times A</annotation></semantics></math></span>. הוכיחו או הפריכו: אם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא יחס רפלקסיבי, סימטרי וגם אנטי-סימטרי, אז <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא יחס שקילות.",
   "solutionHtml": "מכיוון ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>⊆</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R\\subseteq A^2</annotation></semantics></math></span> רפלקסיבי, לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\in A</annotation></semantics></math></span> מתקיים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,x)\\in R</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>נניח ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,y)\\in R</annotation></semantics></math></span> כך ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\ne y</annotation></semantics></math></span>. מכיוון ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span> סימטרי, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(y,x)\\in R</annotation></semantics></math></span>. אז <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,y),(y,x)\\in R</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=y</annotation></semantics></math></span> (כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span> אנטי-סימטרי), סתירה.<br>מסקנה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R=\\{(x,x):\\ x\\in A\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא יחס שקילות. הטענה נכונה."
