   "questionHtml": "חשבו את העוצמה של הקבוצה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi><mo>∩</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S=\\mathbb{Q}\\cap[3,8)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S\\subseteq\\mathbb{Q}\\Rightarrow|S|\\le|\\mathbb{Q}|</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>הקבוצה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>…</mo><mo fence=\"true\">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B=\\left\\{3+\\frac12,\\ 3+\\frac1{2^2},\\ \\ldots,\\ 3+\\frac1{2^n},\\ \\ldots\\right\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> היא תת-קבוצה אינסופית של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|B|=|\\mathbb{N}|</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>מכאן: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\mathbb{N}|=|B|\\le|S|\\le|\\mathbb{Q}|=|\\mathbb{N}|\\Rightarrow|S|=|\\mathbb{N}|</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
