   "topicLabel": "חשבון מודולרי, פרמה, וילסון",
   "questionHtml": "(גרסה 2)<br>הראו ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mn>36</mn><mn>20</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>40</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>80</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>40</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40&lt;\\gcd\\left(36^{20}+40!,\\ 10^{80}+40\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "נסמן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>36</mn><mn>20</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>40</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=36^{20}+40!</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>80</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b=10^{80}+40</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>6</mn><mn>40</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>40</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>6</mn><mrow><mn>41</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>41</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=6^{40}+40!=(6^{41-1}-1)+((41-1)!+1)</annotation></semantics></math></span>. מכיוון ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>41</mn><mo>∤</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">41\\nmid6</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-41 ראשוני, לפי פרמה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>41</mn><mo>∣</mo><msup><mn>6</mn><mrow><mn>41</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">41\\mid6^{41-1}-1</annotation></semantics></math></span>; ומכיוון ש-41 ראשוני, לפי וילסון <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>41</mn><mo>∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>41</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">41\\mid(41-1)!+1</annotation></semantics></math></span>. לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>41</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">41\\mid a</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>80</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>100</mn><mrow><mn>41</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>41</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b=10^{80}+40=(100^{41-1}-1)+41</annotation></semantics></math></span>. מכיוון ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>41</mn><mo>∤</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">41\\nmid100</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-41 ראשוני, לפי פרמה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>41</mn><mo>∣</mo><msup><mn>100</mn><mrow><mn>41</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">41\\mid100^{41-1}-1</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>41</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">41\\mid b</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>מסקנה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>41</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>∧</mo><mn>41</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mn>41</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">41\\mid a\\wedge41\\mid b\\Rightarrow41\\le\\gcd(a,b)</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>41</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40&lt;41\\le\\gcd(a,b)</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
