   "questionHtml": "בכל סעיף עליך להגדיר את המונח הרשום בסעיף ולענות על שאלה קצרה הקשורה אליו.<br><strong>המונח:</strong> יחס טרנזיטיבי.<br><strong>שאלה:</strong> יהיו <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=\\{1,2,\\dots,10\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R\\subseteq A\\times A</annotation></semantics></math></span> יחס טרנזיטיבי.<br><strong>הוכיחו או הפריכו:</strong> היחס ההפוך <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא יחס טרנזיטיבי.",
   "solutionHtml": "<strong>הגדרה:</strong> יחס <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R\\subseteq A\\times A</annotation></semantics></math></span> נקרא טרנזיטיבי אם מקיים התנאי: לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y,z\\in A</annotation></semantics></math></span>, אם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,y)\\in R</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(y,z)\\in R</annotation></semantics></math></span>, אז <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,z)\\in R</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>הטענה נכונה. נניח, בשלילה, שהיחס <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> אינו טרנזיטיבי. אז קיימים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y,z\\in A</annotation></semantics></math></span> כך ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,y)\\in R^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(y,z)\\in R^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, אך <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,z)\\notin R^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>לפי ההגדרה של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> נשיג: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(y,x)\\in R</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(z,y)\\in R</annotation></semantics></math></span> ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(z,x)\\in R</annotation></semantics></math></span> (כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span> טרנזיטיבי). אז נקבל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,z)\\in R^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, בסתירה להנחה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,z)\\notin R^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>מסקנה: אם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span> טרנזיטיבי, אז גם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא יחס טרנזיטיבי.",
