   "questionHtml": "הוכיחו באינדוקציה מתמטית ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^3&lt;2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span> לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\le n\\in\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<strong>I. נבדוק ש:</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>TRUE</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(10)=\\text{TRUE}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mn>1000</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1024</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo>…</mo><mtext> TRUE</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(10):\\ 10^3&lt;2^{10}\\iff 1000&lt;1024\\ \\dots\\ \\text{TRUE}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><strong>II. נבדוק ש:</strong> אם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>TRUE</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(k)=\\text{TRUE}</annotation></semantics></math></span> עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\le k</annotation></semantics></math></span>, אז גם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>TRUE</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(k+1)=\\text{TRUE}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(k):\\ k^3&lt;2^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(k+1):\\ (k+1)^3&lt;2^{k+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>TRUE</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(k+1)^3=k^3+3k^2+3k+1&lt;k^3+3k^2+3k^2+3k^2=k^3+9k^2&lt;k^3+k\\cdot k^2=2\\cdot k^3&lt;2\\cdot 2^k=2^{k+1}\\ \\to\\ P(k+1)=\\text{TRUE}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>מסקנה: לפי משפט האינדוקציה המתמטית הטענה נכונה, כי I וגם II מתקיימים, לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\le n\\in\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
