   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "קבוצות וקבוצת חזקה",
   "questionHtml": "יהיו 3 קבוצות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A,B,C</annotation></semantics></math></span> לא ריקות ושונות. <strong>הוכיחו או הפריכו.</strong><br>(1) <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∪</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⊆</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(B-A)\\cup(C-A)\\subseteq(B\\cup C)-A</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>(2) <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|A|=|\\mathbb{Z}|</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi><mo>∩</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=\\mathbb{Q}\\cap(1,2)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<strong>(1)</strong> טענה נכונה.<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∪</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo>∨</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>B</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo>∨</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∧</mo><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi>C</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall x\\in(B-A)\\cup(C-A)\\Rightarrow x\\in B-A\\ \\vee\\ x\\in C-A\\Rightarrow(x\\in B\\ \\vee\\ x\\in C)\\wedge x\\notin A\\Rightarrow x\\in B\\cup C\\ \\wedge\\ x\\notin A\\Rightarrow x\\in(B\\cup C)-A</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>מסקנה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∪</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⊆</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(B-A)\\cup(C-A)\\subseteq(B\\cup C)-A</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><strong>(2)</strong> טענה נכונה.<br>מכיוון ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A\\subseteq\\mathbb{Q}</annotation></semantics></math></span> נקבל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|A|\\le|\\mathbb{Q}|=|\\mathbb{Z}|</annotation></semantics></math></span>. מצד אחד:<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>⊆</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{1+\\frac12,\\ 1+\\frac13,\\dots,1+\\frac1n,\\dots\\}\\subseteq A\\Rightarrow\\left|\\{1+\\frac12,\\ 1+\\frac13,\\dots,1+\\frac1n,\\dots\\}\\right|=|\\mathbb{N}|\\le|A|</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\mathbb{Z}|=|\\mathbb{N}|\\le|A|\\le|\\mathbb{Z}|</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|A|=|\\mathbb{Z}|</annotation></semantics></math></span>, לפי משפט Cantor-Bernstein.",
