      "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>120</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=2^{120}-1=(2^{12})^{11-1}-1</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>∤</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">11\\nmid2^{12}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן לפי פרמה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">11\\mid n</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
      "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>20</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>25</mn><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m=5^{20}+10!+12!=(25^{11-1}-1)+(10!+1)+12!</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
      "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>25</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">11\\mid(25^{10}-1)</annotation></semantics></math></span> לפי פרמה, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">11\\mid(10!-1)</annotation></semantics></math></span> לפי וילסון, ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>∣</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">11\\mid12!</annotation></semantics></math></span> כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">11</annotation></semantics></math></span> גורם במכפלה.",
      "לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">11\\mid m</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">11\\mid n</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">11\\mid\\gcd(n,m)</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
