   "question": "מצאו $x,y\\in\\mathbb{Z}$ בעזרת האלגוריתם המורחב של EUCLID כך ש: $\\gcd(55,-40)=55x+(-40)y$.",
   "solution": "נריץ את האלגוריתם המורחב על $55,40$ (עמודות: $a,\\ b,\\ \\lfloor a/b\\rfloor,\\ d,\\ x=y',\\ y=x'-y'\\lfloor a/b\\rfloor$):\n```\na    b    [a/b]   d    x     y\n55   40   1       5    3     -1-3*1 = -4\n40   15   2       5    -1    1-(-1)*2 = 3\n15   10   1       5    1     0-1*1 = -1\n10   5    2       5    0     1-0*2 = 1\n5    0    -       5    1     0\n```\n$\\gcd(55,40)=5=3\\cdot55+(-4)\\cdot40$\n$\\gcd(55,-40)=5=3\\cdot55+4\\cdot(-40)$\n$x=3,\\ y=4,\\ d=5$.",
   "solutionSource": "student-solution",
   "official": false,
   "confidence": "med",
   "id": "23A-B-Q2b",
   "partKey": "b",
   "examCode": "23A-B",
   "examLabel": "בדידה 1, סמסטר א' תשפ\"ג, מועד ב (21.02.2023)",
   "year": 2023,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "התחלקות ו-gcd",
   "questionHtml": "מצאו <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y\\in\\mathbb{Z}</annotation></semantics></math></span> בעזרת האלגוריתם המורחב של EUCLID כך ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>55</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>40</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>55</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>40</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gcd(55,-40)=55x+(-40)y</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "נריץ את האלגוריתם המורחב על <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>55</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">55,40</annotation></semantics></math></span> (עמודות: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a,\\ b,\\ \\lfloor a/b\\rfloor,\\ d,\\ x=y&#x27;,\\ y=x&#x27;-y&#x27;\\lfloor a/b\\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span>):<pre class=\"code-block\" dir=\"ltr\"><code>a    b    [a/b]   d    x     y\n55   40   1       5    3     -1-3*1 = -4\n40   15   2       5    -1    1-(-1)*2 = 3\n15   10   1       5    1     0-1*1 = -1\n10   5    2       5    0     1-0*2 = 1\n5    0    -       5    1     0</code></pre><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>55</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>40</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>55</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gcd(55,40)=5=3\\cdot55+(-4)\\cdot40</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>55</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>40</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>55</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>40</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gcd(55,-40)=5=3\\cdot55+4\\cdot(-40)</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=3,\\ y=4,\\ d=5</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
