   "questionHtml": "בכל סעיף עליך להגדיר את המונח הרשום בסעיף ולענות על שאלה קצרה הקשורה אליו.<br><strong>המונח:</strong> פונקציה חד-חד-ערכית.<br><strong>שאלה:</strong> תהי הפונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f:\\mathbb{R}\\to\\mathbb{R}</annotation></semantics></math></span> המוגדרת כך: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=x^3</annotation></semantics></math></span>. הוכיחו שהפונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> היא חד-חד-ערכית.",
   "solutionHtml": "<strong>הגדרה:</strong> תהי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f:B\\to A</annotation></semantics></math></span> פונקציה. <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> תקרא חח״ע אם״ם: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall x_1,x_2\\in B:\\ f(x_1)=f(x_2)\\Rightarrow x_1=x_2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>יהיו <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_1,x_2\\in\\mathbb{R}</annotation></semantics></math></span> כך ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x_1)=f(x_2)</annotation></semantics></math></span>. אז:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext> </mtext><mroot><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mroot><mo>=</mo><mroot><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mroot><mtext> </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x_1)^3=(x_2)^3\\ \\Rightarrow\\ \\sqrt[3]{(x_1)^3}=\\sqrt[3]{(x_2)^3}\\ \\Rightarrow\\ x_1=x_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> היא חח״ע.",
