     "tol": 0,
     "explain": "$4k+4k-2k=6k$ והקבוע $1+3-1=3$ (נבדק בסקריפט עם sympy).",
     "promptHtml": "בצעד: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(4k+1)+(4k+3)-(2k+1)=ak+3</annotation></semantics></math></span>. מהו <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span>?",
     "explainHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4k+4k-2k=6k</annotation></semantics></math></span> והקבוע <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1+3-1=3</annotation></semantics></math></span> (נבדק בסקריפט עם sympy)."
