   "questionHtml": "הוכיחו את הטענה הבאה בשיטת ה-contrapositive:<br>אם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y\\in\\mathbb{Z}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xy</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא מספר זוגי, אז לפחות אחד מהמספרים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span> או <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא זוגי.",
   "solutionHtml": "ראשית, צורת ה-contrapositive של הפסוק אותו אנו רוצים להוכיח היא:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∧</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\exists k_1\\in\\mathbb{Z}:\\ x=2k_1+1)\\wedge(\\exists k_2\\in\\mathbb{Z}:\\ y=2k_2+1)\\to(\\exists k_3\\in\\mathbb{Z}:\\ xy=2k_3+1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>נניח ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=2k_1+1</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=2k_2+1</annotation></semantics></math></span>. אזי:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xy=(2k_1+1)(2k_2+1)=4k_1k_2+2k_1+2k_2+1=2(2k_1k_2+k_1+k_2)+1=2k_3+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_3=2k_1k_2+k_1+k_2</annotation></semantics></math></span>. בזאת הוכחה הגרירה.",
