   "solutionHtml": "כיוון ש-31 הוא ראשוני, לפי משפט וילסון <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>31</mn><mo>∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>30</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">31\\mid(30!+1)</annotation></semantics></math></span>. בנוסף, מתקיים<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>100</mn><mn>150</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>100</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>30</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>30</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100^{150}-1=(100^5)^{30}-1=(10^{10})^{30}-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>ולפי המשפט הקטן של פרמה, מכיוון ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>31</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gcd(10^{10},31)=1</annotation></semantics></math></span> מתקיים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>31</mn><mo>∣</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>30</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">31\\mid\\big((10^{10})^{30}-1\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>31</mn><mo>∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>100</mn><mn>150</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">31\\mid(100^{150}-1)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>מכאן:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mn>31</mn><mo>∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>30</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>∧</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mn>31</mn><mo>∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>100</mn><mn>150</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>⇒</mo><mn>31</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>30</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msup><mn>100</mn><mn>150</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\big(31\\mid(30!+1)\\big)\\wedge\\big(31\\mid(100^{150}-1)\\big)\\Rightarrow 31\\mid\\gcd(30!+1,\\ 100^{150}-1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mn>31</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>30</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msup><mn>100</mn><mn>150</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⇒</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>31</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>30</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msup><mn>100</mn><mn>150</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Rightarrow 31\\le\\gcd(30!+1,\\ 100^{150}-1)\\Rightarrow 30\\le 31\\le\\gcd(30!+1,\\ 100^{150}-1)</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
