   "questionHtml": "מצאו על ידי האלגוריתם המורחב של Euclid שני מספרים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y\\in\\mathbb{Z}</annotation></semantics></math></span> כך ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>48</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>184</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>184</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gcd(48,184)=48\\cdot x+184\\cdot y</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>וגם מצאו <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a,b\\in\\mathbb{Z}</annotation></semantics></math></span> כך ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>48</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>184</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>48</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>184</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gcd(-48,184)=-48\\cdot a+184\\cdot b</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "הטבלה של האלגוריתם המורחב (בכל שורה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא ה-gcd, ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>←</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\leftarrow y&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>←</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y\\leftarrow x&#x27;-y&#x27;\\cdot\\lfloor a/b\\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span> מחושבים מהשורה שמתחת):<pre class=\"code-block\" dir=\"ltr\"><code>  a    b    floor(a/b)   d    x    y\n 184   48        3        8   -1    4\n  48   40        1        8    1   -1\n  40    8        5        8    0    1\n   8    0       --        8    1    0</code></pre><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>184</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>48</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mn>184</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>48</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8=\\gcd(184,48)=(-1)\\cdot 184+4\\cdot 48</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>184</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>48</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mn>184</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>48</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8=\\gcd(184,-48)=(-1)\\cdot 184+(-4)\\cdot(-48)</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=4,\\ y=-1</annotation></semantics></math></span> בסעיף הראשון, ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=-4,\\ b=-1</annotation></semantics></math></span> בסעיף השני.",
