   "questionHtml": "יהיו הקבוצות: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mi>m</mi></msup><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=\\{5^n\\cdot 7^m:\\ m,n\\in\\{0,1,2,\\dots,9\\}\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B=\\{5^n:\\ n\\in\\{0,1,2,\\dots,9\\}\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C=\\{7^n:\\ n\\in\\{0,1,2,\\dots,9\\}\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>חשבו את <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|P(A)\\times P(B\\cup C)|</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>100</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|A|=100\\Rightarrow|P(A)|=2^{100}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>19</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B\\cup C=\\{1,5,\\dots,5^9,7,7^2,\\dots,7^9\\}\\Rightarrow|B\\cup C|=19\\Rightarrow|P(B\\cup C)|=2^{19}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>100</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>19</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>119</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|P(A)\\times P(B\\cup C)|=|P(A)|\\cdot|P(B\\cup C)|=2^{100}\\cdot 2^{19}=2^{119}</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
