   "questionHtml": "הוכיחו בדרך השלילה ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{2}\\notin\\mathbb{Q}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "נניח בשלילה ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt2\\in\\mathbb{Q}</annotation></semantics></math></span>. אז <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt2=\\frac{m}{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span> כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0&lt;m,n\\in\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gcd(m,n)=1</annotation></semantics></math></span> (אפשר לצמצם את השבר עד שהוא מצומצם לגמרי).<br>אז <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m^2=2n^2</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>∣</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\mid m^2</annotation></semantics></math></span> ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\mid m</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m=2t</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>אז <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4t^2=2n^2</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^2=2t^2</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>∣</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\mid n^2</annotation></semantics></math></span> ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\mid n</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>קיבלנו <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\mid m</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\mid n</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\le\\gcd(m,n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>, בסתירה ל-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gcd(m,n)=1</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>מסקנה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt2\\notin\\mathbb{Q}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
